<div id="collapsible" class="sg__header3">Collapsible  <a
    role="button"
    tabindex="0"
    class="icon-search tooltip-icon"
    data-toggle="popover"
    data-placement="bottom"
    title="Find it in the Storefront"
    data-content="
        <ul>
            <li>Footer (xs) <a class='icon-offsite tooltip-icon' href='${URLUtils.https('Home-Show')}' target='_blank' rel='noopener'></a></li>
            <li>Search refinements (sm) <a class='icon-offsite tooltip-icon' href='${URLUtils.https('Search-Show', 'q', 'pants')}' target='_blank' rel='noopener'></a></li>
        </ul>
    "></a></div>
<p>Collapsible lists can be built using the card component and adding a class of <span class="pre">collapsible-</span>, followed by the breakpoint under which the collapsible behavior should be applied. For example, `collapsible-md` would be collapsible on mobile and table only. To make the card collapsible across all breakpoints, use a class of <span class="pre">collapsible-xl</span>.</p>

